# ── Only track these top-level folders ─────────────────────────
# (everything else in C:\NXP\projects, like hello_world, is ignored)
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/tilt_ble/
!/tilt_reader/
!/tilt-maze/

# ── Never push these, in any folder ────────────────────────────
# NXP SDK copy (huge, re-downloadable)
**/__repo__/
# Build output
**/debug/
**/release/
**/build/
**/dist/
*.elf
*.bin
*.srec
*.hex
*.map
# Web dependencies (re-created by `npm install`)
**/node_modules/
# Editor settings with paths specific to your laptop
**/.vscode/
# Logs and OS junk
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
# Environment / secret files, just in case you add any later
.env
.env.*